WEBVTT

01:37.860 --> 01:39.510
I heard all about it, Sakko.

01:39.510 --> 01:40.980
So you like him, huh?

01:41.670 --> 01:44.660
I'll back you up. Just leave 
everything to your oneesan here.

01:44.660 --> 01:46.270
N-No, just wait a...

01:46.270 --> 01:48.010
You want to get to know him, right?

01:48.010 --> 01:49.590
I-It's not like that!

01:49.590 --> 01:51.120
What is it like, then?

01:51.120 --> 01:52.790
Well, it's hard to...

01:55.670 --> 01:57.050
explain it.

01:57.590 --> 02:00.700
It's fine, it's fine! I totally get it.

02:01.400 --> 02:03.630
Yura! Good morning!

02:04.850 --> 02:06.900
You totally don't get it.

02:08.100 --> 02:09.730
Morning, Momo.

02:09.730 --> 02:11.240
Hey, did you see this?

02:12.060 --> 02:13.980
<b>A Mysterious Flying Object!? Numerous Witnesses
Trending on Social Media</b>

02:18.360 --> 02:19.990
Flying Object Seen in the Sky Over Japan

02:18.360 --> 02:19.990
<b>A Mysterious Flying Object!? Numerous Witnesses
Trending on Social Media</b>

02:20.270 --> 02:21.480
What happened?

02:21.740 --> 02:24.750
A video was uploaded to an 
independent net news site.

02:25.130 --> 02:29.360
So our battle wasn't 
actually self-corrected?

02:29.360 --> 02:30.910
But why not?

02:31.130 --> 02:33.870
Does this mean the universe's 
ability to self-correct,

02:33.870 --> 02:38.030
which was directed toward erasing the 
influence of mythic space so far,

02:38.030 --> 02:39.920
is now working the other way around?

02:39.920 --> 02:43.120
It's a synergistic effect of the two stakes.

02:43.120 --> 02:47.740
The direction of the self-correction ability 
determines which universe takes precedence.

02:47.740 --> 02:52.030
Basically, at this rate, the other universe 
will win, and we will all be erased.

02:52.480 --> 02:55.390
Ichiki Hana-san, this is your fault.

02:55.390 --> 02:57.380
Sensei, you shouldn't say that.

02:57.380 --> 03:00.820
It's our fault too that 
we broke out of union.

03:00.820 --> 03:04.860
I heard a voice saying, "kill me."

03:05.550 --> 03:09.280
So we've been killing them, right? 
The people from mythic space?

03:10.170 --> 03:14.340
A Mythic Beast isn't some kind of 
intelligent life that you need to care about.

03:14.340 --> 03:18.880
The Naacal Tablets say that Mythic Beasts 
are "base creatures granted life by God."

03:19.110 --> 03:20.790
They're like monsters or something.

03:20.790 --> 03:23.140
Um, but I heard it talk.

03:23.140 --> 03:27.430
Well, that must have been a message sent 
from Mythic Space by Shadow Angels.

03:27.430 --> 03:29.610
It was meant to confuse you.

03:29.940 --> 03:33.100
They have already sent us 
a lot of images so far.

03:33.100 --> 03:36.650
At any rate, we cannot let 
them place any more stakes.

03:36.890 --> 03:39.490
If they leave one more, 
it will be a disaster.

03:39.490 --> 03:41.560
Everyone, get back to training.

03:42.070 --> 03:45.120
No. I'm quitting.

03:46.050 --> 03:46.850
Fine.

03:50.470 --> 03:51.810
Hana-chan...

03:56.770 --> 04:01.720
S'all my fault that this universe 
might get destroyed, ya know?

04:02.090 --> 04:05.760
But that's still justice, right?

04:06.570 --> 04:11.040
Only those who have awakened to the 
truth are able to attain justice.

04:11.040 --> 04:13.830
Oh. Awakened?

04:15.410 --> 04:20.230
I recall the time when I awakened.

04:29.830 --> 04:34.120
Random Attack on the Streets of Enoshima. Currently Under Investigation.

04:30.340 --> 04:34.110
Space, union, annihilation.

04:34.440 --> 04:37.970
Those words continued to echo in my head.

04:38.280 --> 04:42.270
But the incident was made 
out to be a random attack.

04:42.940 --> 04:45.510
Even my wife's memory of it was erased.

04:47.310 --> 04:51.700
Space, union, annihilation.

04:52.570 --> 04:56.410
As I kept searching for the 
answers, I lost my job.

04:56.410 --> 04:58.390
Then my wife and daughter left me.

04:58.750 --> 05:00.590
That must've been hard.

05:01.250 --> 05:02.110
Oh.

05:09.910 --> 05:10.530
What's this?

05:10.530 --> 05:12.540
<b>Space Egg Council
 Time: Sunday 11:00 a.m.
 Gathering Place: Miyuki Beach, Odawara</b>

05:12.930 --> 05:17.460
Why did Hana decide to quit 
fighting all of a sudden?

05:17.460 --> 05:20.830
She did say there's no way she could 
kill someone she doesn't even like.

05:21.390 --> 05:24.420
That's just like what Sun said.

05:24.870 --> 05:27.850
"Why would you kill something 
you don't even love?"

05:28.710 --> 05:30.160
Sun-kun said that?

05:30.750 --> 05:34.640
I hate the way he always acts 
like he knows what's going on.

05:34.640 --> 05:36.470
But you do like him, right?

05:37.690 --> 05:40.850
I think I get what you said 
earlier. About intuition.

05:42.370 --> 05:44.210
That he isn't a bad guy.

05:45.670 --> 05:46.850
Oh, yeah?

05:47.330 --> 05:49.140
Hey. You've come.

05:52.350 --> 05:53.750
Wh-What's going on?

05:53.750 --> 05:56.740
Go on. You want to talk to him, right?

06:00.060 --> 06:02.110
What the heck am I doing?

06:02.660 --> 06:06.830
Hey, Sun-kun, my friend 
here says he likes you!

06:06.830 --> 06:08.820
Wh-What? Hey!

06:08.000 --> 06:10.430
Don't be embarrassed! It's all good.

06:10.430 --> 06:12.020
C'mon, say something to him.

06:12.430 --> 06:14.650
Why would I be embarrassed?

06:16.480 --> 06:19.820
So, hey, was I inside
 my own mana back there?

06:20.770 --> 06:26.860
I've always thought that I got Sayo 
killed because I couldn't feel fear.

06:27.230 --> 06:31.300
But she really did get 
scared for me instead.

06:32.700 --> 06:35.210
Have you been showing everyone 
else the same thing?

06:35.620 --> 06:41.710
I haven't done anything. I've merely 
pointed out the direction of the mana.

06:41.710 --> 06:45.800
Once everyone recognizes 
their own mana, they awaken.

06:46.240 --> 06:47.710
That's all there is to it.

06:47.710 --> 06:49.860
Recognize their own mana?

06:50.710 --> 06:51.870
Here you go.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.720
<b>Space Egg Council
 Time: Sunday 11:00 a.m.
 Gathering Place: Miyuki Beach, Odawara</b>

06:56.850 --> 06:58.660
You should both come.

07:03.230 --> 07:07.310
<i>We're losing the fight and 
Hana Ichiki has also given up.</i>

07:07.310 --> 07:08.230
<i>There's no hope.</i>

07:08.460 --> 07:10.090
I cannot apologize enough.

07:10.460 --> 07:15.030
There's still some good news, though. 
The students are starting to awaken.

07:15.030 --> 07:17.450
<i>Look. It isn't just Enoshima Academy.</i>

07:17.450 --> 07:20.830
<i>Mana values are rising at
 Element schools around the world.</i>

07:20.830 --> 07:23.500
The mana is being transmitted in a spiral?

07:23.500 --> 07:25.180
It's resonating.

07:25.180 --> 07:30.000
The academy is starting to release 
its power as a morphogenetic field!

07:30.000 --> 07:31.550
<i>It's a ceremony.</i>

07:31.550 --> 07:32.640
Ceremony?

07:32.640 --> 07:35.450
It's sure surprising that the 
students put together a ceremony

07:35.450 --> 07:40.550
to start awakening on their own. It may 
be a form of auto-suggestion, though.

07:40.550 --> 07:43.820
<i>Regardless, their awakening has begun.</i>

07:43.820 --> 07:46.650
<i>If they're able to use it to 
their advantage in battle,</i>

07:46.650 --> 07:50.940
<i>recovering our lost territory 
should be simple.</i>

07:50.940 --> 07:55.620
<i>That'll do away with the need to screen 
people for boarding HAKOBUNE.</i>

07:56.220 --> 08:00.620
Not to worry. We've already got enough 
tickets for you and your families.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.750
Thank you very much.

08:05.100 --> 08:06.840
The egg split into two.

08:06.840 --> 08:10.330
One half became silver and 
the other half became gold!

08:10.330 --> 08:14.790
The things contained inside became 
emotions that are still connected today!

08:14.790 --> 08:18.830
That was the beginning of the universe. 
A tale from inside an egg.

08:18.830 --> 08:20.080
What's that about?

08:20.080 --> 08:21.180
I dunno.

08:21.530 --> 08:22.570
Let's go find out!

08:22.570 --> 08:24.600
Huh? Rimiya-kun?

08:28.260 --> 08:31.380
We haven't gone out together 
like this since primary school.

08:31.380 --> 08:33.300
I forgot all about it.

08:34.590 --> 08:35.870
Wow!

08:35.870 --> 08:39.270
Look, Sakko! The ocean is sparkling!

08:39.270 --> 08:42.020
We see that all the time.

08:43.370 --> 08:46.380
Wow! A big ship!

08:46.380 --> 08:47.810
Are you a little kid?

08:52.750 --> 08:56.900
Wow! Kamisama, it's the ocean!

08:56.900 --> 08:59.550
Space, union, annihilation.

08:59.550 --> 09:01.700
Space, union...

09:08.340 --> 09:09.640
Wow!

09:11.800 --> 09:13.140
C'mon, c'mon!

09:18.490 --> 09:19.710
Sun-kun!

09:21.620 --> 09:23.380
Hey. You both made it.

09:23.370 --> 09:27.370
<b>Space Egg</b>

09:23.630 --> 09:26.150
Welcome to the Space Egg Council.

09:26.150 --> 09:27.380
Nice to meet you!

09:27.380 --> 09:29.940
What are doing here anyway?

09:41.220 --> 09:43.930
Doesn't it feel good to 
do something helpful?

09:44.140 --> 09:45.360
Yes!

09:45.360 --> 09:47.940
Doing good builds up your mana.

09:47.940 --> 09:55.240
<b>Space Egg</b>

09:48.690 --> 09:50.590
That's what Sun taught me.

09:51.470 --> 09:52.780
It's you!

09:53.660 --> 09:54.930
Honey?

09:55.560 --> 09:56.280
Yeah.

09:56.280 --> 09:59.280
I'm so glad you're back with your family.

10:03.740 --> 10:07.980
Oh! It's Momohime-senpai and Sakko-senpai.

10:10.450 --> 10:12.590
This feels so nice!

10:13.560 --> 10:15.640
So what are these guys to you?

10:15.980 --> 10:18.640
These are the people who raised me.

10:18.640 --> 10:20.380
Huh? Raised you?

10:20.660 --> 10:23.140
I was born from an egg.

10:23.140 --> 10:25.100
An egg? Seriously?

10:25.760 --> 10:28.890
On the continent, at a facility 
in the middle of the desert.

10:29.450 --> 10:32.160
It was called the holy egg.

10:32.920 --> 10:38.040
I was raised by people wearing lab coats. 
I didn't have real parents.

10:38.390 --> 10:41.440
That's why I only have 
one name. I'm just Sun.

10:43.030 --> 10:44.870
What do you mean a facility 
on the continent?

10:45.540 --> 10:48.640
It's a test facility for the 
World Awakening Council.

10:49.080 --> 10:51.950
The World Awakening Council?

10:52.700 --> 10:56.600
People who, for hundreds of years, 
have controlled history from the shadows

10:56.600 --> 10:58.680
and ruled humankind.

10:58.680 --> 11:00.920
Yeah, this is getting a little weird.

11:01.160 --> 11:03.730
And I was a member of that organization.

11:04.330 --> 11:05.160
Eh?

11:07.700 --> 11:09.940
What do you think they're 
talking about anyway?

11:09.940 --> 11:11.790
That must be him.

11:11.790 --> 11:12.430
Huh?

11:13.380 --> 11:20.650
The facility was conducting experiments 
to breed a child with special abilities,

11:20.950 --> 11:24.970
or what you might call 
extraordinary powers—a super child.

11:25.400 --> 11:31.040
But their true goal was to 
artificially create a savior.

11:32.180 --> 11:35.750
And that savior is Sun-kun?

11:35.750 --> 11:38.580
There were several others before him.

11:38.580 --> 11:41.640
But they were all failures, 
so they were discarded.

11:42.360 --> 11:43.990
Failures...

11:45.080 --> 11:50.390
The cradle of the Mythic Star Stone was 
connected to all the mana in the world.

11:50.390 --> 11:54.490
That eventually brought forth 
a quantum entanglement.

11:54.490 --> 11:56.860
Elementary particles are vibrating strings.

11:57.460 --> 12:00.230
I met these people inside dreams 
that connected to other worlds.

12:00.230 --> 12:04.210
That's where I met you, too.

12:04.490 --> 12:08.740
Man, I'm a year younger than you. 
I wasn't even born when that happened.

12:08.740 --> 12:12.350
It still feels like I'm in a dream now. 
Still inside the cradle.

12:12.760 --> 12:18.470
And that all of you are a part 
of the dream I'm dreaming.

12:18.470 --> 12:19.960
What's that supposed to mean?

12:20.770 --> 12:26.560
I dream that someday I will be 
born from my true mother's womb.

12:27.430 --> 12:29.350
That is my wish.

12:31.680 --> 12:32.890
Sun-kun...

12:35.350 --> 12:38.620
So Sun has been used by adults, too.

12:39.240 --> 12:41.430
Yeah, just like us.

12:41.730 --> 12:48.960
We rebelled against their inhumane 
experiments, and then took Sun and ran.

12:49.250 --> 12:53.750
Then we formed this group and have been 
fighting against them ever since.

12:53.750 --> 12:56.610
So why did you end up at Enoshima Academy?

12:57.090 --> 13:00.860
Well, that was Sun's wish.

13:01.230 --> 13:02.120
Huh?

13:03.090 --> 13:05.580
In order to awaken everyone.

13:05.580 --> 13:08.610
Also, in order to meet you.

13:08.610 --> 13:09.380
Huh?

13:10.350 --> 13:15.350
I made you a promise, long ago, 
that we would become one.

13:17.900 --> 13:21.160
Oh! Sorry, Sakko! Don't worry! 
It isn't like that between us.

13:21.160 --> 13:22.490
Why would I care?

13:24.600 --> 13:27.270
Sun-kun, would you tell me a story?

13:29.320 --> 13:34.240
I'm sure of it. That is the 
child of the holy egg.

13:34.660 --> 13:36.570
A child of an egg?

13:37.320 --> 13:43.010
A single egg floated above 
the yet oceanless ocean.

13:47.040 --> 13:48.530
You guys seen Toshi?

13:48.530 --> 13:49.720
He's at school.

13:49.720 --> 13:51.620
Huh? But there's no class today.

13:51.970 --> 13:54.060
He's doing the ceremony today.

13:54.720 --> 14:01.090
It was the home of the winged people, 
who lived their lives intertwined with mana.

14:01.090 --> 14:08.640
Soma, a large pillar in which the goddess dwelt, 
nourished all living things there.

14:09.560 --> 14:13.190
The goddess's true form was 
that of a giant snake.

14:13.750 --> 14:19.210
From time to time, the whimsical snake would 
let Soma wither to torture the people.

14:19.590 --> 14:23.090
Oh awakened, bringing salvation 
to those of us who are wingless,

14:23.090 --> 14:23.910
step forward.

14:31.020 --> 14:32.870
Your wings.

14:35.690 --> 14:40.490
When the man entered the cave on 
his way to vanquish the snake,

14:41.020 --> 14:46.570
the goddess was impressed by the man's 
courage and appeared to him as a woman.

14:47.240 --> 14:51.950
The two made love and the 
goddess gave birth to a girl.

14:53.340 --> 14:54.450
Toshi?

14:54.740 --> 14:58.140
Rip out your defiled wings 
and purify your mana!

15:33.820 --> 15:35.870
We will now hold the ceremony

15:35.870 --> 15:39.280
to remove the defiled wings of Sedona, 
daughter of the moon priest.

15:40.000 --> 15:43.310
We pray that this will 
be the final sacrifice.

15:44.400 --> 15:46.180
Removing her wings...

15:46.500 --> 15:47.520
Scary.

15:52.210 --> 15:53.600
Sedona!

15:54.190 --> 15:56.190
Good. Do it.

16:20.840 --> 16:26.400
Ah, Sister! Sister!

16:41.230 --> 16:42.410
Toshi...

16:50.820 --> 16:53.790
What was that just now?

17:00.890 --> 17:02.990
What the heck was that?

17:03.280 --> 17:06.920
I... had my wings pulled out.

17:07.400 --> 17:10.080
And I just stood there. Watching.

17:23.470 --> 17:25.950
Wait. Kamisama?

17:33.880 --> 17:36.120
A rift has formed above the ocean 
two kilometers from Odawara!

17:36.110 --> 17:41.080
Amaha Momohime

17:36.110 --> 17:41.080
Otori Sakko

17:36.540 --> 17:39.130
Summon the Elements immediately!

17:39.840 --> 17:40.700
Huh?

17:43.490 --> 17:44.450
It's a Mythic Beast.

17:44.450 --> 17:46.450
At Odawara?

17:44.450 --> 17:47.790
Amaha Momohime

17:44.450 --> 17:47.790
Otori Sakko

17:46.450 --> 17:50.080
<i>You're both in the perfect spot. 
We'll send the Vector Machines to you!</i>

17:53.820 --> 17:56.350
My back really hurts.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.300
Toshi...

17:59.650 --> 18:03.540
I'll be okay. You should go, Rimiya-kun.

18:20.120 --> 18:22.700
A Mythic Beast has appeared!

18:27.100 --> 18:29.480
<i>Vector Machines, prepare for launch.</i>

18:29.850 --> 18:32.240
<i>All units, launch sequence.</i>

18:32.660 --> 18:35.630
<i>Bridge catapult, activate launch sequence.</i>

18:36.040 --> 18:37.330
<i>Release bridge.</i>

18:37.780 --> 18:39.880
<i>Vector Siegel, launching.</i>

18:41.730 --> 18:45.990
<i>Iwaya cave, launch sequence 
initiated. Thrust at maximum.</i>

18:45.990 --> 18:47.930
<i>Vector Tir, launching.</i>

18:52.360 --> 18:55.060
<i>Yacht harbor, launch sequence initiated.</i>

18:55.440 --> 18:57.780
<i>Prepare for launch. Thrust at maximum.</i>

18:58.200 --> 19:00.030
<i>Vector Feoh, launching.</i>

19:09.540 --> 19:12.470
<i>Sakko, Momohime-neesama, get in!</i>

19:18.690 --> 19:21.550
What were you guys doing in Odawara anyway?

19:21.550 --> 19:22.710
Well, that's...

19:22.710 --> 19:25.300
It isn't important! 
We have to stop the Mythic Beast!

19:25.300 --> 19:28.220
Those two are in excellent condition.

19:28.220 --> 19:32.850
Yes. Their mana values have reached 
battle levels. They can unite.

19:33.210 --> 19:34.990
Guys, time to unite!

19:35.280 --> 19:38.460
Mythic Star Union! Go, Aquarion!

19:41.870 --> 19:44.690
The Mythic Beast is closing in
 to place another stake!

19:44.690 --> 19:46.570
Don't let it get close to the city!

19:47.410 --> 19:49.220
<i>Let's do this, guys!</i>

20:11.680 --> 20:12.650
<i>Oh, no!</i>

20:20.330 --> 20:21.280
<i>We've gotta stop it!</i>

20:21.280 --> 20:23.740
<i>No! There are people below!</i>

20:27.970 --> 20:29.870
<i>Watch out! Dodge them!</i>

20:39.370 --> 20:41.920
<i>I will kill you all.</i>

20:42.140 --> 20:43.470
<i>It spoke!</i>

20:47.270 --> 20:48.980
Momohime-senpai!

20:56.770 --> 20:59.690
<i>And you call yourself a true warrior?</i>

20:59.930 --> 21:01.050
What is it doing?

21:18.620 --> 21:20.380
We have to focus our strength!

21:21.640 --> 21:23.220
I'll knock it out of the sky!

21:50.850 --> 21:53.210
It completed the triangle!

21:53.210 --> 21:56.370
This is bad! Don't let the 
Mythic Beast get away!

22:00.870 --> 22:01.920
<i>Wait!</i>

22:03.220 --> 22:06.670
No, stop! It's too dangerous 
to get any closer!
